---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Versiones de Link" active="linkversiones">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 py-4 sm:py-6 w-full space-y-4">
    <header class="glass-panel px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl">
      <span class="text-[12px] font-display font-bold text-galaxy-400 uppercase tracking-widest bg-galaxy-600/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-galaxy-400/30">Solo admin</span>
      <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-extrabold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-shadow-glow mt-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-download text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Versiones de Phoenix Link</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs mt-0.5">Las versiones que subes con <code>EMPAQUETAR-RELEASE.ps1 -Subir</code> llegan aquí sin publicar. Cuando publicas una, cada Link la ve en menos de 1 hora y se actualiza con un botón.</p>
    </header>

    <div id="lv-sinsesion" hidden class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-8 text-center text-gray-400 text-sm">Inicia sesión para continuar.</div>
    <div id="lv-denegado" hidden class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-8 text-center text-sm">
      <p class="text-white font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Esta página es solo para el admin</p>
    </div>

    <div id="lv-app" hidden class="space-y-4">
      <div id="lv-error" hidden role="alert" class="rounded-xl border border-rose-400/40 bg-rose-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-rose-200 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i><span id="lv-error-txt" class="flex-1 min-w-0"></span>
        <button type="button" id="lv-reintentar" class="btn btn-ghost !min-h-8 !px-3 !text-[12px]">Reintentar</button>
      </div>
      <section id="lv-resumen" class="glass-panel rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-200" aria-live="polite"></section>
      <section class="space-y-2.5">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-box-archive text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Versiones</h2>
        <div id="lv-versiones" class="space-y-2.5"></div>
      </section>
      <section class="space-y-2.5">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-desktop text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Qué versión tiene cada PC</h2>
        <div id="lv-pcs" class="glass-panel rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto"></div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
<script>
  import '../js/pages/linkVersiones.js';
</script>
